{"parse": {"title": "春日迟-06", "pageid": 134678, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-05\" title=\"春日迟-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">春日迟-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-07\" title=\"春日迟-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">春日迟</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.A2.E8.BF.A2.E5.A4.8D.E6.82.84.E6.82.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"迢迢复悄悄\">迢迢复悄悄</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 迢迢复悄悄</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Sorrows of a Distant Past</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">船夫：</div><div>三、二、一，好，抛缆——前头慢些，别撞上了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">船工：</div><div>茶呢？来人帮个手！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后一批货也上了船，人声鼎沸的渡口渐渐安静下去。杏花树的倒影在夕阳下浮动，一只白鸟掠过金色的水面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>师姐，这就是气脉凝滞之处吗？看起来似乎没什么异常啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我还以为会山峦崩摧、寸草不生呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>难怪师父生你的气。他平日的话，你是不是只拣那些惊天动地的部分听？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>你说的是揽诸苏醒时气蕴紊乱的景象，但气脉凝滞并非如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哦——我记起来啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>是不是说，气脉凝滞的地方，一切都会被封存起来，从此不再变化——无法生长，也不会消亡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>不尽然。如此彻底的封存，需得有极厉害的法器才行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>就像师父的法剑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>你啊……怎么总对这些稀奇古怪的事格外上心？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>更常见的情形是，气脉凝滞处的生机会悄然流逝。最初也许看不出，随着日月更迭，衰亡之象也会日益显现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>听起来很是严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>可大可小。大则山峦倾覆，小则……或许只是一丛草木的枯荣。在迹象显现之前，谁也无法断言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>也就是说，可能整个镇子都会遭殃，也可能只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬头看向自己倚靠着的杏花树。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>只是它未来不再开花？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>嗯。无论如何，我们得防患于未然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我方才探查过，此地仍受上次揽诸复苏的余波影响，气脉略有滞涩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>问题不算严重，只是难以根除，还须每隔一段时间加以疏导。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>那太好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——咳咳，我是说，太好了，往后我还能和师姐一道下山！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不过，下一回要到什么时候呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年长些的道人含笑瞥她一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>约莫……两百年后吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>在那之前，你已经能独自游历了，不必再跟着我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>两、两百年？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>两百年前，此地还是僻无人居的山野。两百年后的现在，还是同一个地方，津渡繁华，商贾船只来来往往，络绎不绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>等再过去两百年……不知这里会是什么模样？沧海桑田恐怕不易，但我们所见的风物，定然已与现在大不相同了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>江风拂过，几片粉白花瓣零星落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪伸手抓住其中一片，拿到眼前。她盯着它已经微微蜷曲的、开始干枯发黄的边缘，又仰头看了看树梢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314116.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-314116.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314116.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314116.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-314116.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314116.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-314116.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314116.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>两百年的时间，都能让这棵树长得像我们白马派的那株梅树一样高大了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>或许。倘若它足够幸运，不遭刀斧，不遇天灾——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>否则，两百年也足以让它被人遗忘了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔。我还以为，知道只是救一棵树以后，你会失望呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我既然答应了老丈帮忙，就一定要做到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>再说了，能救活一棵树也是很好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>只是……我们该从哪里开始？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女仰头望着那棵许久没有开花的树，迟疑良久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我也勘察过一二，难的并不仅仅是疏通气脉，也在于，此地有一处仙人设下的法阵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我想，仙人应是经行此地发觉有异，便设阵疏导。百余年过去，这法阵难免日益磨损，故而气脉又渐渐凝滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>可这毕竟是仙人术法，我……我实在不知该如何补全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>无妨，我知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……你知道？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这不是仙人术法，只是我师门常用的法阵，我从小不知见过多少回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>对了，你的师门……一路上你并未提过。那是什么样的地方？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>在涣州。不过我派门人甚少下山游历，你未必听说过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>嗯……听着像是不沾红尘、适合修行的好地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>倒也不是。师父说，从前也有前辈在山下行走，据说连圣人也曾问道于掌教……只是此一时彼一时嘛，世上哪有长盛不衰的门派。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>至于门中弟子——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>想必都如你一般，是本领高妙的修行之人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>如我一般？也不是，大家各有志趣罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我，你已经见到了。我入门最晚，性子又跳脱，很受大家照顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>二师兄性子急，总是在练剑。他不大像高人，像话本里的恶人，对谁都看不起。他下山的次数最多，最爱管别人的闲事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>三师兄不常说话，把道藏翻了一遍又一遍，瞧着倒有些像高人。不过他喜欢教训人，那些斥责的话文绉绉的，有时大家都听不太明白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我还有一个师姐，我们关系是最好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>她性子好，得师父喜欢。平日有什么事，我们都找她帮忙；谁受了师父的罚，也总托她求情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>她……但她也不像高人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>传说里的高人性子都不太好，和她不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>她……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>江风拂过，几片残叶从枯枝上簌簌落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她出声提醒望着杏花树发呆的道人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？哦，抱歉抱歉，方才在想别的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>说回这阵法。我虽没专门学过，但门中几乎人人都会，想来也没什么难的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你看好了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪两指并在一处，一道莹白的气在她指尖盘旋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>哇——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>贯炁明素，宸洞开微！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在空中划了道阿措看不明白的复杂符箓，又向杏花树的方向虚虚一指。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>着！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵裹挟着枯草的清风吹过树梢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，这就结束了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>是了——你之前说过，此事并不棘手。如此，自然不会有什么风云变色的大场面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>咳咳……这个嘛。要解决起来确实不难……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她尴尬地轻咳了两声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不过情况和之前的设想似乎……略有出入，我得想些别的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>略有出入？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>只是略有！虽然此阵确是我派中人所设，加固它的方法……我还要斟酌斟酌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>法阵本身并不复杂。但若要加固，须得用与布阵时一致的手法运转其中的“气”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>否则，施术者修为越深，对阵法的破坏反而越大。唔，这法阵已经很脆弱了，一不留神就可能彻底崩毁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我们得慎之又慎……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忽然停住，迟疑着在杏花树的枝干上轻叩两下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这法阵运气的方式好生眼熟。这……似乎是我师姐设下的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>太好了！那，你现在是不是能解开它了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……这是为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措微微一愣，抬眼看向鹭鸶剪。后者也正望着她，两人对视，都有些茫然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我记得你说，你向来随师门一道下山，那这一次，会不会就是和你师姐一起来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……或许是吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>听你刚才所言，你们感情颇深，你一定很了解她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>自然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>那……既然布阵之人与你如此亲近，你应当熟悉她施术的习惯与手法吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>当时的情境……我已经想不起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>唉，这样啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女有些失落地思索着，绕着杏花树转了两圈，突然停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，我还有个主意！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>既然此阵是你师姐所设，而破解之道又在于重现她的施术手法，我们何不请教她本人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>起初我束手无策，所以请来了你；如今你也没有十全把握，那找到最初布阵的人，就是最好的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她认真地建议着，越说越觉得可行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>对！我们得暂且离开几天，但这不成问题。哪怕错过今春的花期，只要解决了气凝之事，尚可以待来年……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……恐怕有些困难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>她是在外云游，还是闭关修行？这都不打紧，你们既然是同门，总有联络的办法吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>联络的办法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>或许有吧。只是，我并未修习过招魂之术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>嗯……嗯？招魂之术？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你，你是说，你师姐已经……不在人间？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "春日迟-06"}}